            "\\subsection{Baselines}\n",
            "XLNet \\citep{yang2020xlnet} is an autoregressive Transformer-based \\citep{vaswani2017attention} language model which sees various word order permutations of the inputs during pre-training. We append a linear layer to the mean-pooled output of XLNet to obtain an XLNet-based classifier. This model has achieved SOTA performance on many text classification datasets, including AG News.\n",
            "\n",
            "SEQ2SEQ-PTR \\citep{rongali2020generate} is based on sequence-to-sequence \\citep{sutskever2014sequence} and pointer generator networks \\citep{vinyals2015pointer,see2017pointer}; it achieves SOTA IC/SL performance on Snips, ATIS, and TOPv2. It transduces from an unlabeled utterance to a sequence with labeled spans (including the intent label, where the span is the entire sentence).\n",
